packages/data/.mtgjson-cache/

# Claude Code worktrees and session state (git worktrees live under .claude/worktrees/).
# `.claude/*` rather than `.claude/`, because git does not descend into an excluded
# DIRECTORY -- a negation inside one can never re-include anything. Excluding the
# contents instead leaves the directory itself visible, so `!` works below.
.claude/*
# TRACKED ON PURPOSE: the player-persona reviewer agents and their harness. They are a
# measuring instrument with a validated track record, they carry the fixtures and the
# scoring rules, and the last time these personas lived only in a session the prompt text
# was lost and every round had to be re-improvised.
!.claude/agents/
.cr-cache/
